        "content": "<p>rvolosatovs opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14958\">PR #14958</a> from <code>rvolosatovs:wizer/trim-wasmtime-feature</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><code>wasmtime</code> feature enabled some <code>wasmtime</code> features that do not seem to be used by Wizer, which seems to originate from <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/11805\">https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/11805</a></p>\n<p>Some features, like <code>wasmtime/cache</code> for example, make integrating this crate more difficult, e.g. <code>wasmtime-wizer</code> does not compile to <code>wasm32-unknown-unknown</code> because of the cache feature enabled.</p>\n</blockquote>",
